<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51410" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἴτων</span></b>  [<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῐ], ὁ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					St.Byz.
				</span></i>
			, and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἴτωνος</span></b> , ὁ, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				9.5.8
			</span></i>, a town in Thessaly: —hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἰτωνία</span></b> , ἡ, title
			of Athena who was worshipped there, <i><span class="en">
				Hecat.
				2J.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				1.13.3
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				10.1.10
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρυσαιγίδος Ἰτωνίας ναός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					B.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					11.2
				</span></i>
			; also at Coronea, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				4.25.2
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				25.3.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				9.2.29
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				9.33.1
			</span></i>; at Athens, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12.310.217
			</span></i>; at Amorgos, ib.<i><span class="en">
				12(7).33
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἰτωνιάς</span></b> , ἡ,
				<i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Cer.</u>
				75
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.743
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Theodorid.
			</span></i>): <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἰτωνίς</span></b> , ἡ, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.551
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.130
			</span></i> (&lt;<i><span class="en">
				Leon.
			</span></i>&gt;).</div>
